  "term": "dermatological disorder",
  "definition": "In this source, a dermatological disorder refers to a skin-related condition in which chronic itch can become persistent and disabling. It may involve ongoing spontaneous itching and repeated scratching that worsens skin damage and reduces quality of life.",
